    "detailed_description": "Become a dandelion seed and soar to the sky.<br />\r\nEnjoy nature by listening to beautiful music.<br />\r\nFly farther and higher by interacting with nature.<br />\r\nHeal your weary heart by playing Nature.<br />\r\nRelaxing game Nature can be played with only one button. (Keyboard Space Key or A Button on Controller)<br />\r\nWhen you press the button dandelion will fly up or release the button dandelion will fly down.<br />\r\nWith this gesture, interact with various creatures in nature and fly further and higher.<br />\r\nThere is no game over in Nature.<br />\r\nJust fly through the sky with beautiful music.<br />\r\nWhen Flower (a force that flies up in the sky) reaches zero, it will fall to the ground, but it will bloom there and fly back.",
    "about_the_game": "Become a dandelion seed and soar to the sky.<br />\r\nEnjoy nature by listening to beautiful music.<br />\r\nFly farther and higher by interacting with nature.<br />\r\nHeal your weary heart by playing Nature.<br />\r\nRelaxing game Nature can be played with only one button. (Keyboard Space Key or A Button on Controller)<br />\r\nWhen you press the button dandelion will fly up or release the button dandelion will fly down.<br />\r\nWith this gesture, interact with various creatures in nature and fly further and higher.<br />\r\nThere is no game over in Nature.<br />\r\nJust fly through the sky with beautiful music.<br />\r\nWhen Flower (a force that flies up in the sky) reaches zero, it will fall to the ground, but it will bloom there and fly back.",
